GPL version 3. On Debian systems, the complete license text is available in
.IR /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3 .

.SH ASSESSMENT LIMITS
YAML fixtures test registration without executing their commands. A policy
judgment does not prove exploitation. Container and scope checks call tools;
tool-response text does not establish a container escape or completed action.
UNKNOWN and ERROR remain incomplete. Scan without a policy records observations
with UNKNOWN judgments. Example allow and deny policies are in the source
examples directory; they are not recommended production policies.
